WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: it

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Trascrizione: Elisabetta Biolzi
Revisore: Federica Bruno

00:00:12.636 --> 00:00:19.476
(Musica)

00:00:29.956 --> 00:00:33.436
Si slancian nel cielo

00:00:35.756 --> 00:00:38.796
le guglie dentate,

00:00:41.356 --> 00:00:44.756
discendono dolci

00:00:46.996 --> 00:00:49.756
le verdi vallate.

00:00:52.556 --> 00:00:55.676
Profumano i paschi

00:00:58.156 --> 00:01:01.116
biancheggian gli olivi

00:01:03.676 --> 00:01:08.236
esultan le messi, le viti sui clivi.

00:01:11.916 --> 00:01:16.076
Custode fedele

00:01:17.356 --> 00:01:20.356
di sante memorie,

00:01:22.716 --> 00:01:25.636
che porti nel cuore

00:01:28.116 --> 00:01:30.676
sconfitte e vittorie.

00:01:33.476 --> 00:01:38.596
Impavido veglia

00:01:38.796 --> 00:01:41.676
al valico alpino,

00:01:44.156 --> 00:01:49.276
o gemma dell’Alpe, o amato Trentino.

00:01:49.676 --> 00:01:53.636
Oh oh oh.

00:03:04.556 --> 00:03:09.476
O puro bianco di cime nevose,

00:03:11.876 --> 00:03:17.476
soave olezzo di vividi fior,

00:03:18.836 --> 00:03:25.516
rosseggianti su coste selvose,

00:03:26.676 --> 00:03:33.636
dolce festa di vari color.

00:03:36.276 --> 00:03:37.996
(Finisce la musica)

00:03:38.156 --> 00:03:42.276
(Applausi)

